  "description": "Narrow Vintage is a bold and rugged western display font inspired by classic cowboy typography, vintage saloon signs, old western posters, and rustic Americana aesthetics. Featuring strong slab serifs, condensed proportions, and a distressed vintage character, this font delivers an authentic Old West feel while remaining highly readable and impactful.\nPerfect for western logos, cowboy branding, ranch designs, rodeo posters, saloon signs, country apparel, T-shirt designs, vintage badges, labels, posters, packaging, signage, and rustic merchandise. Its bold display style works especially well for headlines, logos, titles, and designs that need a strong vintage western personality.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Narrow Vintage is a bold and rugged western display font inspired by classic cowboy typography, vintage saloon signs, old western posters, and rustic Americana aesthetics. Featuring strong slab serifs, condensed proportions, and a distressed vintage character, this font delivers an authentic Old West feel while remaining highly readable and impactful.</p>\n<p>Perfect for western logos, cowboy branding, ranch designs, rodeo posters, saloon signs, country apparel, T-shirt designs, vintage badges, labels, posters, packaging, signage, and rustic merchandise. Its bold display style works especially well for headlines, logos, titles, and designs that need a strong vintage western personality.</p>",
